message: "If you use this code, the benchmark protocol or the stored rejection scores, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "fruit-ripeness-osr: open-set recognition for postharvest fruit ripeness grading"
abstract: "Code, experiment records (12,728 runs) and stored rejection scores for a ten-dataset benchmark of open-set postharvest ripeness phenotyping across six rejection arms and two score families."
